# AI Image Editor - Project Setup

## Tech Stack Requirements
- **Package Manager**: pnpm (NOT npm/yarn) - Always use `pnpm add` for dependencies
- **Framework**: Next.js 15 with App Router
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4 - Use utility classes and mobile-first approach
- **UI Components**: shadcn/ui - Install with `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add [component]`
- **AI SDK**: Vercel AI SDK v5 (@ai-sdk/openai) - Use generateImage function
- **TypeScript**: Strict mode enabled - All files must be properly typed

## Installation Commands
- Dependencies: `pnpm add [package]`
- shadcn components: `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add [component]`
- Dev dependencies: `pnpm add -D [package]`

## File Structure
```
app/
├── api/edit-image/route.ts     # Vercel AI SDK integration
├── page.tsx                    # Main page with ImageEditor
└── layout.tsx                  # Root layout
components/
├── ui/                         # shadcn components
├── ImageUpload.tsx            # File upload component
├── PromptInput.tsx            # Text input component
├── GeneratedImage.tsx         # Result display component
└── ImageEditor.tsx            # Main orchestrator
```

## Environment Variables
- Keep API keys in environment variables
- Use OPENAI_API_KEY for OpenAI integration
- Never expose API keys in client-side code